tcxAPv7n9RZpVIl4MWjJzfAgj.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_EventLogin_2","category":"event","text":"我准备好了。老师呢？","text_original":"私は準備OK。先生は?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/WgePYfKOxOUwvCAkhMhGWRC2wYd7I4K1.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_EventLogin_Season_1","category":"event","text":"进展相当不错嘛。","text_original":"かなり進んだわね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/PQADofUFT5ym7J7AgSf6mwlP62Ow9RRg.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_EventLogin_Season_2","category":"event","text":"看样子都完成得差不多了？","text_original":"もうほとんど終わった感じよね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/fZU4KO24P2f8LsxfMnRnXhc9jSSwY5AM.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_EventLogin_Season_End","category":"event","text":"总之，最后还是再检查一遍吧。","text_original":"一応、もっかい確認してみて?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/CN8KDQoGAXGdfAHJju71JunowQNrFho6.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"等会儿可别后悔！","text_original":"後で後悔するんじゃないわよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/SgXFqjx0BHEb1YsRDAfjKXZTVHgoxIRY.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"既然要动手……","text_original":"そっちがやる気なら!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/tSl7HKX64lEI7jUqouJXZgzRUWZdpK60.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"想看我出手？那好……！","text_original":"そんなに見たいなら！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/x5HOcE6D1FJbbVRLr8opbNyMWIQBlA0x.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"给我看好了！","text_original":"よく見てなさい!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/RFXhYygTA6FtwJLn9uv19Gl7inX3hbpp.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"接招！","text_original":"くらえ!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/v