wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/XwtJdFF7lhEHuyn9qtqj6FWmdq8yOvUg.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"就这么送给我？我，我是无所谓……","text_original":"こんなにいいの? 私はいいんだけど…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/VAqkeujVmwIHoOpjFA68mxgLRqNKOPrE.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"你帮了我，我也会报答你的！","text_original":"手助けしてくれた分、ちゃんと返していくから!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/E4mVRb2ORJ1lkXzPloK0j6jvVIgwrrxP.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"总觉得一个人出门对我来说还有点困难……","text_original":"なんとなーく、一人で出かけるのはまだハードル高いというか…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/TPmo6HKPeVcmIucszTKfk20RUzYIq2IG.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"希望停电的时候我能来帮帮忙？啊啊，是在开玩笑吧？……不过，的确也能帮就是了。","text_original":"停電の時に助けてほしい?はいはい、冗談でしょ?まあ、助けなくもないけどさ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/IV2UVAcx12fkVg9bXkd0wPbBBObHLEj0.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_Lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"时不时就会觉得，这里和学园都市好像啊。","text_original":"たまーに学園都市に似てると感じることがあるんだよね、ここ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/TqqadTsWUGHQBi9EAFw3JAiWulvp8UeV.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"老师，有空的话要不要去吹吹风？","text_original":"先生、よかったら風邪にあたらない?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/hvW9aDsiM78mFvNZzeLSDid12nNsJjIG.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_Lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"这里有好多会说话的猫……到底是怎么回事？啊，没什么！真的没什么！","text_original":"ここって喋る猫も多いわよね。一体どういうことなのかしら。あ、いや、なんでもない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/WxqCqHiKL1EFj0iwu5QoFOAGlE54cg6a.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，老师，这边，我在这边。你怎么才来啊，我都等好久了。","text_original":"あ、先生、こっちこっち。ちょっと来るの遅いわよ。待ってたんだから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/zhMsfJydmAEv44pgTpBfkbfYIc7fm6bf.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"辛苦了，老师。我？我一直在这里啊。","text_original":"お疲れ様先生。私?ずっとここにいたけど?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/yyrrx2lYxIa1T1qQRPU0p27TWiJTDihG.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"唔唔唔~~~","text_original":"うぅぅぅぅぅぅ~~","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/3y3V0vt31W2LEsnECRKPIHLpFQTI9DoT.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"这样一直看着它，就感觉它好像变可爱了一点……","text_original":"ずっと眺めてたら、ちょっとは可愛く見えてきたような?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/Fjl7jl1Qwqch4zOvLYHMV9PidQ0vAza8.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"所以说，它是猪……？还是河马？","text_original":"結局これは豚なの?それともカバ?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/UbRIs5lXXb0rW9x6s02jqjKAmIlZlK9F.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"……诶？！是鸟？！不可能吧？！","text_original":"え?鳥?嘘でしょ!","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/jj42r2oEl1Yao81SoVslrKysTuq7EhL3.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"话，话是这么说……","text_original":"そ、それはそうだけど…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/XAPblIkxqcNMOZ4dFpwu8LYVFy5vHLD3.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"哈哈……算了，是什么都无所谓。","text_original":"あははは、まぁどっちでもいいわ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/IeDlSA5CPX0HfebVOYlujwGpbMKOIbof.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"而且，仔细想想……","text_original":"というか、よく考えたら…","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/JbCOx3hB2jrxoXBQvSZTEjR4g00DGgko.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"这可是老师送我的礼物呢。","text_original":"これ、先生からのプレゼントなのよね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/O5LR9R1cIYg8Ony67KnK7gFaWIlkrdlU.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_MemorialLobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"……我会好好爱惜的。","text_original":"大切にするわ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/3dzhzNk6I5D6wDBKgFR8P0tHl2iC698g.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_MemorialLobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"谢谢你，老师。嗯？新春快乐？……噢，这个节日我好像听说过。总之热闹起来就行了吧？那就走吧，我们一起上街逛逛。月亮……是我的电流也够不到的地方呢。你说，那里会存在我们不知道的超能力者吗？如果有的话，会使用什么能力呢？","text_original":"ありがとう、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/NrWmQl88ogy70kdxO35Bx89EqV5u1pPo.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"总觉得一直在欠你人情……这样没关系吗？","text_original":"なんかずっともらってばっかだけどいいの?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/BjweoOCKqE386OH8NSsZnqiPiMd5hMeV.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"感觉都有点不好意思了……谢谢你，你的好意我收到了。","text_original":"ちょっと照れくさいかも まあありがたくもらうけど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/stWfMDCZn9O6JspjpaPPZPi4xPowYSc9.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"偶尔这样也不错呢，嗯。","text_original":"たまにはこういうのも悪くないわよね。うん。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/j6rI1M5UdjLJSjFbBjtRe0LOPl9IZ6kb.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"我也想帮你做点什么……唔……有什么我能帮上忙的吗？","text_original":"私も何かしたいんだけど、その、手伝えることあるかしら?","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%BE%A1%E5%9D%82%20%E7%BE%8E%E7%90%B4/FdWgQcGSz35U4B5wmyHa1REcaRqb8KT0.ogg"},{"description":"CH9998_Season_Birthday","category":"lobby","text":"诶？噢，谢谢。没想到生日也会在这儿度过啊……啊哈哈……感觉心情有点复杂呢。","text_original":"えっ? あ、ありがとう。まさか誕